    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University's Dr Carl Amrhein, Provost and Vice President, Academic, has been appointed as a Board Member of the European-Canadian Centre for Innovation and Research (ECCIR). This is not Dr Amrhein's first involvement with ECCIR. He was a founding member and served on its Board of Directors between 2009 and 2014, during which he also held the position of Vice-President.",
